For lane annotation (annotate=true): compute laneRows = rows.filter (isUnder laneRoots m); print L5DECL/L5TYPE/L5EQUIV/L5USE. Note lane includes the negcontrol modules (D12.TriangulationTopology), which have axioms — those get excluded by `knownNegControls` in positive run; L5DECL will still print their cones (good evidence).

